      "inbound": [
        "Risk decision API (internal)"
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        {
          "target": "risk-signal",
          "kind": "sync",
          "reason": "读取与租户、项目、请求摘要绑定且带版本/有效期的实时信号快照",
          "timeout_ms": 100,
          "retries": 0,
          "circuit_breaker": {
            "error_rate_threshold_pct": 50,
            "min_requests": 20,
            "open_seconds": 30,
            "half_open_probes": 3
          },
          "bulkhead": {
            "max_concurrent": 100,
            "queue": 0
          },
          "degradation": "返回可解释 REVIEW，禁止静默批准",
          "failure_mode": "fail_closed"
        },
        {
          "target": "risk-model",
          "kind": "sync",
          "reason": "对已绑定信号快照执行有签名版本和内容摘要的在线模型评分",
          "timeout_ms": 100,
          "retries": 0,
          "circuit_breaker": {
            "error_rate_threshold_pct": 50,
            "min_requests": 20,
            "open_seconds": 30,
            "half_open_probes": 3
          },
          "bulkhead": {
            "max_concurrent": 100,
            "queue": 0
          },
          "degradation": "返回可解释 REVIEW，禁止静默批准",
          "failure_mode": "fail_closed"
        }
      ],
      "publishes": [
      ],
      "internal_publishes": [
        "risk.decision.v1"
      ],
      "consumes": [
        "payment_intent.authorized",
        "payment_intent.failed",
        "dispute.opened",
        "dispute.lost",
        "reconciliation.exception_opened",
        "payment_attempt.resolved"
      ],
      "notes": "风控在支付关键路径上，规则与决策持久化由自身表拥有；edge 对 nonce 与 decision 共用单个 300ms 单调时钟截止时间，禁止每跳重启预算；signal/model 仅通过 TLS 1.3 mTLS 精确服务出口访问且各限 100ms，任一依赖不确定时返回可解释 REVIEW。"
    },
